<title>HONG KONG: Swire lifts price in Island Plc phase two.</title>
<headline>Swire lifts price in Island Plc phase two.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swire Properties Ltd said on Monday it will lift the selling price of housing units in the second phase of its Island Place development by one percent to HK$6,435 per sq ft.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to start presale of another 128 units in October, after the first phase of 112 units were heavily oversubscribed earlier this month.</p>
<p>An inital 48 units were sold at an average of HK$6,282 and an addition of 64 flats at HK$6,362 per sq ft, the company said.</p>
<p>The development has three residential towers with a total of 784 units scheduled to be completed by end of of 1996.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6369</p>
